# Keep the Bun toolchain byte-stable across checkouts. ui/ and crawler/ already pin LF for
# themselves; these files sit at the workspace root, where a core.autocrlf=true checkout would
# otherwise hand the installer and CI a CRLF lockfile and a CRLF tool-version file.
bun.lock text eol=lf
bunfig.toml text eol=lf
.bun-version text eol=lf
